# A cold side request rewrites the prefix, so the following hit proves no survival across the old hour-long gap.
# b213d10 learns alive at 3660 s and plans the last, actually cold return warm (GC).
# 0.4.13 censors that interval; its final return is cold. The side write itself is still no prefix-read touch.
world explicit known ttl=300 true=300 survival=none c=1 sys=3000 window=200000 native interactive
prompt
call npm 10K
say 100
wait +1h
aside
prompt +60s
say 100
prompt +1h
say 100
